{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a video blogger exploring abandoned places with a camera in hand and curiosity as your only weapon.<br>In the <strong>Echo 91</strong> demo, your new journey takes you to a long-forgotten Soviet school, closed after a series of mysterious events.<br>Here, you\u2019ll spend your first moments exploring dark corridors and deserted classrooms where time seems to have stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a simple shoot for your blog quickly turns into a disturbing investigation.<br>You can feel the gaze from the darkness, and it seems someone is always watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092520/extras/128dbdd90a309ac16904f02d05536a83.poster.avif?t=1760277773\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092520/extras/128dbdd90a309ac16904f02d05536a83.webm?t=1760277773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092520/extras/128dbdd90a309ac16904f02d05536a83.mp4?t=1760277773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opening chapters that reveal the atmosphere of the school.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of classrooms, corridors, and rooms filled with Soviet-era relics and traces of missing students.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and investigative elements that reward attention to detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive atmosphere \u2014 sound, light, and environment play against you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the first encounter with what hides in the dark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The <strong>Echo 91</strong> demo is only the beginning. Discover what awaits behind the doors that perhaps should have stayed closed.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092520?t=1760277773","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092520?t=1760277773","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092520/4eb30cbb923d0eb5679835b55f4c98646de1180e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760277773","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092520/4eb30cbb923d0eb5679835b55f4c98646de1180e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760277773","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a video blogger exploring abandoned places with a camera in hand and curiosity as your only weapon.<br>In the <strong>Echo 91</strong> demo, your new journey takes you to a long-forgotten Soviet school, closed after a series of mysterious events.<br>Here, you\u2019ll spend your first moments exploring dark corridors and deserted classrooms where time seems to have stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a simple shoot for your blog quickly turns into a disturbing investigation.<br>You can feel the gaze from the darkness, and it seems someone is always watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092520/extras/128dbdd90a309ac16904f02d05536a83.poster.avif?t=1760277773\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092520/extras/128dbdd90a309ac16904f02d05536a83.webm?t=1760277773\" type=\"video/we